SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 4pm\, 6:30pm\nThirty-four days before she’s sent
  to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a s
 keptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate 
 portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey i
 nto the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Op
 penheim comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/mo
 vie/you-can-see-everything\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/bost
 on/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
